00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Where on Earth can crews train for the Moon and Mars?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
We compare Earth with thirteen Moon and Mars sites, using open, sourced data.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Nineteen Earth sites, five pillars. Jordan's Harrat al-Shaam is the closest twin of Jezero Crater.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Then we score all of Jordan the same way. The data agrees with our pick.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Satellites show what the ground is made of. Next, our field kit.

6
